          "mirrored": false,
          "attributes": {
            "text": "Four full adders, one per bit, with\nbit 0 at the top. Each one is two half\nadders and an OR, like the Full adder.\n\nThe carry ripples down: C1 is bit 0's\ncarry out and bit 1's carry in.\n\nIt opens on 9 + 5 = 14:\nA = 1001, B = 0101, S = 1110.\nRead each number from bit 3 up to bit 0.",
            "color": "blue"
          }
        }
